AI raised engineering velocity for 93% and governance workload for 97%.

@ActiveState's new report, The AI Remediation Bill, surveyed 307 enterprise security, governance, platform, and engineering leaders and found that 93% report increased engineering productivity from AI-assisted development, while 97% report a heavier governance workload.

